    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/4fc71d227d4a6e37b277e49cc6573d37.avif?t=1691178557\" /></div><br>Holt is very ealy in development and is subject to drastic changes throughout its lifetime. Please be mindful when playing or testing the game. If you run into any errors please leave any feedback on our discussions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/30714185c72edc530c686f3b5a8c5fc3.avif?t=1691178557\" /></div><br><br><br><br><strong>Holt will be releasing on a chapter basis and each new chapter will evolve the story more!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/c9eb067697165c3dbe8fffe121cadf86.avif?t=1691178557\" /></div><br><br>Holt is a 2D action platformer with a rich story. Shoot, slash, and adventure through levels of enemies and meet new friends along the way. Find out what has happened in the past and find out what the future holds.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/4683adf14e2e78de80b0099959997a16.avif?t=1691178557\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Colorful characters</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rich combat</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customization</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In-depth lore</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the world after the war</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/49a73d7ae8d9112693d648750fe0e687.poster.avif?t=1691178557\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/49a73d7ae8d9112693d648750fe0e687.webm?t=1691178557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/49a73d7ae8d9112693d648750fe0e687.mp4?t=1691178557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dig up the past</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/000ac1dd92eef6f7d34b8ff129935efe.poster.avif?t=1691178557\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/000ac1dd92eef6f7d34b8ff129935efe.webm?t=1691178557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/000ac1dd92eef6f7d34b8ff129935efe.mp4?t=1691178557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/4fc71d227d4a6e37b277e49cc6573d37.avif?t=1691178557\" /></div><br>Holt is very ealy in development and is subject to drastic changes throughout its lifetime. Please be mindful when playing or testing the game. If you run into any errors please leave any feedback on our discussions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/30714185c72edc530c686f3b5a8c5fc3.avif?t=1691178557\" /></div><br><br><br><br><strong>Holt will be releasing on a chapter basis and each new chapter will evolve the story more!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/c9eb067697165c3dbe8fffe121cadf86.avif?t=1691178557\" /></div><br><br>Holt is a 2D action platformer with a rich story. Shoot, slash, and adventure through levels of enemies and meet new friends along the way. Find out what has happened in the past and find out what the future holds.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/4683adf14e2e78de80b0099959997a16.avif?t=1691178557\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Colorful characters</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rich combat</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customization</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In-depth lore</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the world after the war</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/49a73d7ae8d9112693d648750fe0e687.poster.avif?t=1691178557\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675600/extras/49a73d7ae8d911269